{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01258","headline":"相和歌辞 雁门太守行 · 张祜","name":"相和歌辞 雁门太守行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城头月没霜如水，趚趚蹋沙人似鬼。\n灯前拭泪试香裘，长引一声残漏子。\n驼囊泻酒酒一杯，前头啑血心不回。\n寄语年少妻莫哀，鱼金虎竹天上来，雁门山边骨成灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}